"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tripadvisor.fr\u002FTourism-g6-Africa-Vacations.html","name":"Afrique"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tripadvisor.fr\u002FTourism-g293730-Morocco-Vacations.html","name":"Maroc"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tripadvisor.fr\u002FTourism-g2626673-Souss_Massa-Vacations.html","name":"R\u00E9gion de Souss-Massa-Draa"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"item":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tripadvisor.fr\u002FTourism-g293731-Agadir_Souss_Massa-Vacations.html","name":"Agadir"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":5,"item":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tripadvisor.fr\u002FHotels-g293731-Agadir_Souss_Massa-Hotels.html","name":"H\u00F4tels Agadir"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":6,"name":"Safar Budget"}]}</script></div></div></div><div></div><div data-test-target=faq-json-ld><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\u002F\u002Fschema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Quelles sont les attractions populaires proches de Safar Budget\u00A0?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Parmi les attractions \u00E0 proximit\u00E9, il y a F\u00E1brica de alfombras artesanales (0,7 km) et Parakid's (0,4 km). \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tripadvisor.fr\u002FHotel_Review-g293731-d10786713-Reviews-Safar_Budget-Agadir_Souss_Massa.html?m=63287&faqts=Hotel_Review&faqtup=geo%3A293731%3Bdetail%3A10786713&faqtt=119&faqtqr=1\" \u003EAffichez toutes les attractions \u00E0 proximit\u00E9.\u003C\u002Fa\u003E"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Quels sont les services offerts par Safar Budget\u00A0?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Le wi-fi gratuit, restaurant et parking gratuit sont des services appr\u00E9ci\u00E9s par les voyageurs. \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tripadvisor.fr\u002FHotel_Review-g293731-d10786713-Reviews-Safar_Budget-Agadir_Souss_Massa.html?m=63287&faqts=Hotel_Review&faqtup=geo%3A293731%3Bdetail%3A10786713&faqtt=121&faqtqr=2\" \u003EAffichez tous les services de l'\u00E9tablissement.\u003C\u002Fa\u003E"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Quelles options de boisson et nourriture sont disponibles \u00E0 Safar Budget\u00A0?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Les clients peuvent profiter de restaurant pendant leur s\u00E9jour. \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tripadvisor.fr\u002FHotel_Review-g293731-d10786713-Reviews-Safar_Budget-Agadir_Souss_Massa.html?m=63287&faqts=Hotel_Review&faqtup=geo%3A293731%3Bdetail%3A10786713&faqtt=125&faqtqr=3\" \u003EEn savoir plus\u003C\u002Fa\u003E"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Peut-on se garer chez Safar Budget\u00A0?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Oui, parking gratuit et parking s\u00E9curis\u00E9 sont \u00E0 la disposition des clients. \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tripadvisor.fr\u002FHotel_Review-g293731-d10786713-Reviews-Safar_Budget-Agadir_Souss_Massa.html?m=63287&faqts=Hotel_Review&faqtup=geo%3A293731%3Bdetail%3A10786713&faqtt=127&faqtqr=4\" \u003EEn savoir plus\u003C\u002Fa\u003E"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Quels sont les restaurants proches de Safar Budget\u00A0?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Exemples de restaurants bien situ\u00E9s\u00A0: La Cantine D'agadir, Dak-Art et Mikey's burger. \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tripadvisor.fr\u002FHotel_Review-g293731-d10786713-Reviews-Safar_Budget-Agadir_Souss_Massa.html?m=63287&faqts=Hotel_Review&faqtup=geo%3A293731%3Bdetail%3A10786713&faqtt=129&faqtqr=5\" \u003EAffichez tous les restaurants \u00E0 proximit\u00E9.\u003C\u002Fa\u003E"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Les animaux sont-ils autoris\u00E9s dans Safar Budget\u00A0?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Oui, les animaux sont g\u00E9n\u00E9ralement autoris\u00E9s, mais il vaut mieux appeler avant pour confirmer.  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tripadvisor.fr\u002FHotel_Review-g293731-d10786713-Reviews-Safar_Budget-Agadir_Souss_Massa.html?m=63287&faqts=Hotel_Review&faqtup=geo%3A293731%3Bdetail%3A10786713&faqtt=136&faqtqr=6\" \u003EEn savoir plus\u003C\u002Fa\u003E"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Quelles langues sont parl\u00E9es par le personnel de Safar Budget\u00A0?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Le personnel parle plusieurs langues, dont Anglais, Espagnol, Fran\u00E7ais, Allemand et Arabe.  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tripadvisor.fr\u002FHotel_Review-g293731-d10786713-Reviews-Safar_Budget-Agadir_Souss_Massa.html?m=63287&faqts=Hotel_Review&faqtup=geo%3A293731%3Bdetail%3A10786713&faqtt=141&faqtqr=7\" \u003EAffichez tous les services de l'\u00E9tablissement.\u003C\u002Fa\u003E"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Y a-t-il des sites historiques proches de Safar Budget\u00A0?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"De nombreux voyageurs aiment visiter My Morocco Experience (4,7 km), Aguinane (5,5 km) et Agadir Transfer (7,3 km).  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tripadvisor.fr\u002FHotel_Review-g293731-d10786713-Reviews-Safar_Budget-Agadir_Souss_Massa.html?m=63287&faqts=Hotel_Review&faqtup=geo%3A293731%3Bdetail%3A10786713&faqtt=145&faqtqr=8\" \u003EAffichez toutes les attractions \u00E0 proximit\u00E9.\u003C\u002Fa\u003E"}}]}</script></div><div class="mXiGB f e y"><div class=WbjZV><div class="IDaDx cyIij fluiI SMjpI Iwmxp"><div class="wWwSb VogJa"><div class="vJSwn f e u j AWyOK"><div id=slot:728x90-970x66:header class="Eufjb j u w"></div></div></div><div class="CsunT l"></div><div class="wWwSb VogJa"><div data-test-target=hr-atf-info><div class="TCaFW f"><div class=Pj><span class="biGQs _P VImYz egaXP ZNjnF">Comment les paiements qui nous sont versés affectent l&#x27;ordre d&#x27;affichage des prix. Les types de chambre peuvent varier.</span><div class=DgJpu><button type=button class="ypcsE _S wSSLS" aria-labelledby=:lithium-R8ra9auinjlq:><div class=ferko><span class="biGQs _P VImYz ZNjnF"><u>En savoir plus</u></span></div></button><span id=:lithium-R8ra9auinjlq: class="KrpDA o"><div class=SupMt><div class="biGQs _P VImYz ZNjnF">La page des offres de réservation pour chaque établissement prend en compte la compensation que nos partenaires nous versent. Les prix affichés peuvent varier en fonction du type de chambre. Les prix s&#x27;affichent par prix le plus bas disponible, ce qui correspond au type de chambre disponible le moins cher selon les prix fournis par nos partenaires au moment de la recherche de l&#x27;utilisateur.</div></div></span></div></div></div><div class="ZlaHM f k"><div class="WMndO f"><h1 id=HEADING class="biGQs _P CIuBz">Safar Budget</h1></div><div class="WgQFn f"><div class="IRzhD d _T Vt Cq"><div><button class="UikNM _G B- _S _W u _T c G_ wSSLS wnNQG" type=button aria-label=Partager data-automation=shareCta><span class="biGQs _P ezezH" data-automation=shareCta.text><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width=20px height=20px class="d Vb UmNoP" aria-hidden=true><path fill-rule=evenodd clip-rule=evenodd d="m12 .94 4.102 4.101-1.06 1.06-2.292-2.29V12.5h-1.5V3.81L8.959 6.103l-1.061-1.06zM4.043 8.301C4.505 7.73 5.2 7.25 6.003 7.25H8v1.5H6.004c-.196 0-.503.134-.793.494-.28.347-.461.81-.461 1.256v7.956c0 1.17.72 1.794 1.254 1.794h11.992c.538 0 1.254-.628 1.254-1.794V10.5c0-.448-.18-.91-.46-1.257-.289-.359-.596-.493-.794-.493H16v-1.5h1.996c.806 0 1.501.48 1.963 1.052.47.585.791 1.372.791 2.198v7.956c0 1.638-1.072 3.294-2.754 3.294H6.004c-1.674 0-2.754-1.645-2.754-3.294V10.5c0-.826.322-1.614.793-2.198"></path></svg></span></button></div></div><button type=button aria-label="Enregistrer dans un voyage" class="vKDXe u j _T z _S _F xwbQG cunPs jODdB updsl LrRuD" data-automation=trips-save-button-item-10786713><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width=20px height=20px class="d Vb icjEL" aria-hidden=true><path fill-rule=evenodd clip-rule=evenodd d="M3.798 5.166A5.77 5.77 0 0 1 7.72 3.63c1.455 0 2.857.548 3.922 1.536l.005.005.341.322.332-.317a5.77 5.77 0 0 1 3.928-1.54c1.458 0 2.862.55 3.928 1.54l.004.004c1.093 1.032 1.598 2.324 1.569 3.662-.03 1.323-.579 2.643-1.5 3.785-.884 1.096-2.85 2.943-4.547 4.478a185 185 0 0 1-3.153 2.785l-.06